  Kvantum template by Himprakash Deka, GPL-2.0-or-later. Recoloured and
  reconfigured for ShaniOS by build-kvantum.py / build-palette.py.

Plasma styles Saturn and Saturn-Dark (usr/share/plasma/desktoptheme/Saturn*)
  Utterly-Round Plasma Style by Himprakash Deka,
